flowchart TD
    U[User request] --> EX[Intent extraction - planner]
    EX --> C[Contract - shape-tagged acceptance criteria]
    C --> AG[Agent executes - generator - tools and edits]
    AG --> EV[Completion verifier - per-criterion, content-grounded, coherence]
    EV --> Q{Overall status?}
    Q -->|complete| DONE[Report success with quoted evidence]
    Q -->|incomplete| ARB[Four-way arbiter - classify each unmet criterion]

    ARB --> R{Route by failure class}
    R -->|unsatisfied - genuine gap| FIX[Build targeted feedback - list unmet criteria plus guidance]
    R -->|blocked - tool denied or failed| USER1[Surface blocker to user - grant approval or fix environment]
    R -->|ambiguity - unclear intent| CLAR[Ask one clarification question]
    R -->|spec-gap - inferred criterion| CONF[Confirm or adjust the contract with the user]

    CLAR --> C
    CONF --> C
    FIX --> B{Iteration budget left?}
    B -->|yes| MEM[Add reflexion note - why each criterion failed last time]
    MEM --> AG
    B -->|no| STOP[Stop and report honestly - what is done, what remains, what is needed]
    USER1 --> STOP

    DONE --> ENDN([Done])
    STOP --> ENDN

    classDef existing fill:#1f3a5f,stroke:#4a90d9,color:#eaf2fb
    classDef newloop fill:#3f2a12,stroke:#d98a3a,color:#fbf0e2
    class U,EX,C,AG,EV,Q,DONE,ARB,R existing
    class FIX,USER1,CLAR,CONF,B,MEM,STOP newloop
